{"type":"json_object","message":"I interpret the requested increase over 2007 and 2008 as the net change from the beginning of 2007 to the end of 2008. Inputs: 2008 ending balance = 214.4 (source:t8c1n0) and 2007 beginning balance = 70.5 (source:t1c2n0), both in $ millions. Calculation: 214.4 - 70.5.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"end_2008 - begin_2007","variables":{"end_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"millions"},"begin_2007":{"value":70.5,"source":"source:t1c2n0","unit":"millions"}},"sources":{"end_2008":"source:t8c1n0","begin_2007":"source:t1c2n0"}}}